# Participant data — NEVER commit. This repository is public on GitHub, and
# git history is permanent: a CSV of minors' names, emails, and phone numbers
# committed once is public forever, even if deleted in a later commit.
# scripts/vcards.mjs refuses to read or write inside this working tree, but
# these patterns are the backstop for a manual drag-and-drop.
*.csv
*.vcf
*.vcard
roster*
participants*
registrations*
